---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Wire Mesh Specification Tables — Mesh, Wire, Weight, Standards" description="Central hub for wire mesh spec tables: mesh-to-micron, wire gauge, weight calculators, ASTM/ISO standards, and product spec sheets.">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">Wire Mesh Specification Tables</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-theme-secondary">
      Every specification table and calculator on MeshCalculator in one place — mesh counts, wire gauges,
      theoretical weights, and the standards that define tolerances.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Conversion tables & charts</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a href="/charts/mesh-size-chart/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Mesh Size Chart</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Mesh count ↔ micron ↔ inch for 4–400 mesh, with typical uses per range.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/mesh-count-conversion/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Mesh–Micron Converter</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Interactive converter with ASTM E11 sieve table.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/wire-gauge-conversion/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Wire Gauge Conversion</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">AWG & SWG to mm/inch, both directions.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/blog/wire-mesh-size-chart-explained/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Mesh Size Chart Explained</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">How to read mesh counts, wire diameter, and opening.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Weight calculators</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <a href="/tools/welded-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Welded Mesh Weight</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Theoretical kg/m² and kg/panel.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Woven Mesh Weight</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Plain & twill weave, rolls and cut pieces.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Container Loading</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary"> rolls/panels per 20' and 40' container.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Reference standards</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-sm border border-theme">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-theme-card text-theme-primary">
            <th class="border border-theme px-3 py-2 text-left">Standard</th>
            <th class="border border-theme px-3 py-2 text-left">Scope</th>
            <th class="border border-theme px-3 py-2 text-left">Used for</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="odd:bg-theme even:bg-theme-card">
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-primary">ASTM E11</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">Woven wire test sieve cloth</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">Mesh count ↔ micron definitions</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="odd:bg-theme even:bg-theme-card">
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-primary">ASTM A974 / A974M</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">Welded wire mesh fabric</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">Concrete & industrial welded mesh</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="odd:bg-theme even:bg-theme-card">
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-primary">ASTM A641 / A641M</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">Zinc-coated (galvanized) steel wire</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">Galvanized wire & mesh coating classes</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="odd:bg-theme even:bg-theme-card">
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-primary">ASTM A580</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">Stainless steel wire</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">304/316 wire for woven mesh</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="odd:bg-theme even:bg-theme-card">
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-primary">ISO 9044</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">Industrial woven wire cloth</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">International mesh tolerances</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="odd:bg-theme even:bg-theme-card">
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-primary">ISO 4782</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">Woven wire test sieves</td>
            <td class="border border-theme px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-secondary">Sieve mesh definitions outside ASTM</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">Product specification sheets</h2>
    <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a href="/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Welded Wire Mesh Specs</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Common panel sizes, wire diameters, openings.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/products/chain-link-fence/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Chain Link Fence Specs</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Gauge, mesh, height, coating options.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/products/stainless-steel-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Stainless Steel Mesh Specs</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">304 vs 316, weave types, micron ratings.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/products/gabion-baskets/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">Gabion Basket Specs</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Wire dia, mesh opening, box dimensions, coatings.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-theme-primary">Can't find the table you need?</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-theme-secondary">
        <a href="/inquiry/" class="text-theme-accent font-semibold">Send us your spec</a> — if a common spec table is missing we will add it, and we can route your requirement to verified Anping factories.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">Related Guides</h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <a href="/blog/welded-vs-woven-wire-mesh/" class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-theme-primary transition block">
          <div class="font-semibold text-theme-primary">Welded vs Woven Mesh</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Weave types explained</div>
        </a>
        <a href="/blog/304-vs-316-stainless-steel-mesh/" class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-theme-primary transition block">
          <div class="font-semibold text-theme-primary">304 vs 316 Stainless</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">Material selection guide</div>
        </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
